WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.960
<b>HIT IT EXACT 
 Pour in exactly 2000g of water and get a great prize.</b>

00:00:06.510 --> 00:00:08.860
4117 grams!

00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:11.600
2117 grams over.

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:12.940
How unfortunate!

00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:14.250
Look at that.

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:17.080
I told you we didn't need the last cup!

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:19.580
You're blaming me? You're 
always blaming others.

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:21.680
Is there a prize for getting close?

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:24.630
I don't think we're anywhere near the mark.

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:26.470
You put too much water in!

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:27.870
You're the one who added the last cup!

00:00:29.480 --> 00:00:32.760
Something's been off since the 
beginning of the second semester.

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:34.450
<b>High Schooler Quiz 
 Intense battles are here!!</b>

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:35.010
First question!

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:37.300
Which civil war era general became famous...

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:38.970
for giving salt to his enemies?

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:41.590
Giving salt?

00:00:41.590 --> 00:00:43.480
What kind of old lady was he?

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:44.660
Give up already.

00:00:45.970 --> 00:00:49.760
Summer's long over, fall is ending...

00:00:50.140 --> 00:00:52.630
and the cultural festival has started...

00:00:54.290 --> 00:00:56.790
Victory is sweet.

00:00:56.790 --> 00:00:59.620
You didn't get a single question right.

00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:03.360
Kaname-kun ended up getting 
seven questions in a row.

00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:06.710
Something's not right...

00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:09.660
Poor Cinderella.

00:01:09.660 --> 00:01:12.810
Her stepmother and sisters must 
have bullied her again today.

00:01:14.660 --> 00:01:15.970
Oh, sorry.

00:01:16.310 --> 00:01:17.870
Are you all right?

00:01:17.870 --> 00:01:19.720
What are you looking at?

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:28.950
Here.

00:01:28.950 --> 00:01:30.490
Shun-chan...

00:01:30.490 --> 00:01:31.620
Thanks.

00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:35.310
Something's not right.

00:03:01.590 --> 00:03:06.040
A single flower blooms in the 
darkness surrounding our school.

00:03:06.410 --> 00:03:09.870
It is the origin of my name.

00:03:10.170 --> 00:03:12.830
Bathroom Hanako-san in 
the cultural festival!

00:03:14.310 --> 00:03:18.130
I'll even make the famous Hanako-san my own.

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:20.980
My appeal's limitless.

00:03:20.980 --> 00:03:22.320
Hold on, Chizuru-kun.

00:03:23.370 --> 00:03:26.400
I'm quite famous myself.

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:29.640
What is that, Yukki? 
You look so cool!

00:03:30.160 --> 00:03:34.150
It'd be perfect if my dad was here, though.

00:03:34.150 --> 00:03:35.010
What?

00:03:35.010 --> 00:03:39.170
Hey! Hanako-chan's the focus of the day!

00:03:39.170 --> 00:03:43.150
No, my dad's the real deal...

00:03:43.150 --> 00:03:46.850
Hey, what are you still doing here?

00:03:46.850 --> 00:03:48.600
People will be coming soon.

00:03:51.840 --> 00:03:53.550
Kanamecchi, Kanamecchi!

00:03:54.280 --> 00:03:56.220
Stop laughing!

00:03:56.220 --> 00:03:58.920
Whose fault do you think this is?

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:00.950
But don't you think it's a bit fruity?

00:04:00.950 --> 00:04:02.220
Not at all.

00:04:03.420 --> 00:04:04.610
My wig!

00:04:04.610 --> 00:04:08.040
Hanako-san, a woman's hair is everything.

00:04:08.040 --> 00:04:10.470
What are you doing? That hurt!

00:04:10.470 --> 00:04:12.110
It hurts me to see it, too.

00:04:12.110 --> 00:04:14.700
We're opening the haunted 
house for business.

00:04:14.700 --> 00:04:16.810
Ghosts, give it your best.

00:04:15.170 --> 00:04:16.810
Come on, let's hide.

00:04:17.170 --> 00:04:19.570
Are we really clumping together like this?

00:04:26.090 --> 00:04:27.770
Someone's coming.

00:04:28.270 --> 00:04:29.470
What? Where? Where? Where?

00:04:29.470 --> 00:04:30.830
Hey, hey...

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:31.540
I'm so scared.

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:33.500
Just hold on and you'll be fine.

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:33.820
Okay.

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:37.130
Ignore them.

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:40.800
I can't stand the thought of someone 
using us for their relationship!

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:44.700
We're not Cupid, we're demons and ghosts.

00:04:44.700 --> 00:04:46.430
If you're a ghost, you scare them.

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:48.440
Okay, keep walking!

00:04:48.440 --> 00:04:49.920
Th-That's Yutan's voice!

00:04:49.920 --> 00:04:50.760
Yuta.

00:04:50.760 --> 00:04:53.950
Sorry I came with you...

00:04:53.950 --> 00:04:57.970
Don't apologize. I feel better if there
 are more people with me...

00:04:58.400 --> 00:04:59.390
Yuta!

00:05:00.210 --> 00:05:02.520
Yuta.

00:05:04.060 --> 00:05:06.140
I'm Hanako-san!

00:05:08.020 --> 00:05:10.740
Wait, you're going the wrong way...

00:05:09.040 --> 00:05:11.580
It's Kaname-kun!

00:05:12.650 --> 00:05:15.590
What do you mean by that?

00:05:15.590 --> 00:05:18.250
Oh, um... I mean...

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:20.400
Why aren't you wearing your vest?

00:05:20.740 --> 00:05:24.080
I thought this would help me 
blend into the darkness more.

00:05:24.080 --> 00:05:25.630
Yuki-kun, you're so smart!

00:05:25.950 --> 00:05:28.200
You were pretty scared, Mary.

00:05:28.200 --> 00:05:31.380
Are you stupid? What are you wearing?

00:05:31.380 --> 00:05:33.640
I'm so scared.

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:35.100
More people are coming!

00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:36.140
You guys should go!

00:05:36.380 --> 00:05:37.320
Okay.

00:05:37.320 --> 00:05:38.350
I'm off too.

00:05:38.350 --> 00:05:39.940
Me too!

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:41.650
You guys are ghosts.

00:05:41.990 --> 00:05:45.370
Hanako may be a ghost, 
but she's also a girl.

00:05:45.370 --> 00:05:46.400
Who cares?

00:05:46.800 --> 00:05:48.990
Don't you think rokurokubi 
are too popular?

00:05:49.350 --> 00:05:51.020
I don't want to hear it.

00:05:51.020 --> 00:05:52.740
Sorry.

00:05:52.740 --> 00:05:55.830
Mary, even if you're scared, try not to cry.

00:05:55.830 --> 00:05:57.770
What are you talking about?

00:05:57.770 --> 00:06:01.050
A haunted house like this 
is too funny to be scary!

00:06:01.050 --> 00:06:02.130
I see.

00:06:09.290 --> 00:06:12.190
It's dark! It's scary! No more!

00:06:15.760 --> 00:06:17.820
Masaki-chan, are you okay?

00:06:17.820 --> 00:06:20.560
Y-Yeah, I'm fine.

00:06:20.560 --> 00:06:22.010
Let's go together.

00:06:23.090 --> 00:06:24.530
O-Okay.

00:06:26.180 --> 00:06:28.300
Is the exit still far?

00:06:28.300 --> 00:06:31.060
I want to get out of this dark place.

00:06:31.060 --> 00:06:32.820
We're almost there.

00:06:32.820 --> 00:06:33.700
Okay.

00:06:35.500 --> 00:06:37.160
We finally made it out.

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:38.250
Wasn't it scary?

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:41.390
Yeah, but it was fun.

00:06:41.390 --> 00:06:43.060
So bright.

00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:47.810
Ow!

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:51.260
What? Why'd you slap me?

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:53.420
Why were you holding my hand?

00:06:53.420 --> 00:06:55.140
Pervert! Predator!

00:06:55.140 --> 00:06:58.980
What? That's ridiculous!

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:01.300
You grabbed my hand!

00:07:01.300 --> 00:07:04.550
I never would've done that if 
I'd known it was yours!

00:07:04.550 --> 00:07:06.980
I missed my chance!

00:07:08.270 --> 00:07:09.700
So not cute.

00:07:12.310 --> 00:07:14.940
What's her problem? I was just trying to...

00:07:18.400 --> 00:07:20.230
Say cheese.

00:07:22.240 --> 00:07:23.460
Wait, what?

00:07:23.460 --> 00:07:24.910
What do you mean, what?

00:07:26.780 --> 00:07:28.540
What are you two talking about?

00:07:31.410 --> 00:07:35.100
Do they really have no intention of coming back?

00:07:36.980 --> 00:07:39.650
I hope my shift ends soon.

00:07:44.070 --> 00:07:46.590
Sis, you're screaming way too much.

00:07:46.590 --> 00:07:47.770
Another customer.

00:07:47.770 --> 00:07:49.490
Here we go.

00:07:50.030 --> 00:07:54.110
Re...ve...n...ge

00:07:58.380 --> 00:08:00.280
That was great.

00:08:00.280 --> 00:08:01.590
Shut up.

00:08:04.030 --> 00:08:06.420
Stop laughing, Hisako!

00:08:07.120 --> 00:08:10.050
What are you doing here?

00:08:13.120 --> 00:08:15.840
This sucks.

00:08:16.440 --> 00:08:18.730
That look really suits you.

00:08:18.730 --> 00:08:20.100
No, it doesn't!

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:21.970
You are taking it off?

00:08:21.970 --> 00:08:25.130
It's fine. It's about the end...

00:08:25.130 --> 00:08:28.160
Really? Do you have some time after this?

00:08:28.160 --> 00:08:28.940
Why?

00:08:29.290 --> 00:08:31.650
Do you want to walk around with us?

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:34.980
We'll get lost by ourselves.

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:36.900
Sure.

00:08:37.880 --> 00:08:41.070
Aren't you in the Student Council?

00:08:41.070 --> 00:08:43.900
Can you get us to the front of all the lines?

00:08:43.900 --> 00:08:45.210
No.

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:47.540
Kaname-kun, you're in the Student Council?

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:49.440
Yeah.

00:08:49.440 --> 00:08:51.070
That's amazing.

00:08:51.070 --> 00:08:52.880
It's nothing, really.

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:56.260
It's amazing. It's really amazing.

00:08:59.240 --> 00:09:02.680
Fine, it's amazing.

00:09:03.580 --> 00:09:04.790
I'm going to get changed.

00:09:05.450 --> 00:09:08.640
<b>Homare High School 
 Chocolate Bananas</b>

00:09:05.960 --> 00:09:07.830
There's a long line here.

00:09:07.830 --> 00:09:09.600
Yakisoba and chocolate covered bananas...

00:09:09.600 --> 00:09:11.310
are the stars of this festival.

00:09:12.430 --> 00:09:14.150
Um, hello?

00:09:16.980 --> 00:09:19.560
Hey! Don't ignore me!

00:09:20.100 --> 00:09:22.220
Don't cut in line.

00:09:22.220 --> 00:09:25.490
Huh? Are we lining up from 
shortest to tallest?

00:09:25.490 --> 00:09:26.580
No!

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:28.040
Then, who cares?

00:09:28.040 --> 00:09:29.740
I care!

00:09:29.740 --> 00:09:31.270
Go to the end of the line.

00:09:31.270 --> 00:09:34.310
Chizuru, if you get in a fight 
with people looking like that,

00:09:34.310 --> 00:09:36.040
Kaname will get mad at you.

00:09:36.040 --> 00:09:37.660
I'm not starting a fight!

00:09:37.660 --> 00:09:39.860
I'm just telling off this—

00:09:39.860 --> 00:09:41.030
Ko-chan!

00:09:41.030 --> 00:09:42.430
Hey, wait!

00:09:42.430 --> 00:09:44.170
"Ko-chan?"

00:09:44.170 --> 00:09:46.210
He knows Azuma-sensei?

00:09:46.210 --> 00:09:47.440
I dunno.

00:09:47.870 --> 00:09:50.070
Who does he think he is?

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:52.440
<b>Fairy Tale Cafe</b>

00:09:51.040 --> 00:09:52.440
Excuse me!

00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:54.820
Yutan, Shun-chan!

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:57.540
You came.

00:09:57.540 --> 00:09:59.320
Of course.

00:09:59.810 --> 00:10:04.060
You told us you'd be 
working this afternoon.

00:10:04.060 --> 00:10:06.210
You two look so cute.

00:10:06.860 --> 00:10:08.240
Really?

00:10:08.240 --> 00:10:09.880
Yuta, you're beautiful.

00:10:10.150 --> 00:10:11.820
Are you Little Red Riding Hood?

00:10:11.820 --> 00:10:12.720
Yes.

00:10:12.720 --> 00:10:18.510
I can really see you 
getting eaten by a wolf!

00:10:18.970 --> 00:10:19.680
What?

00:10:20.240 --> 00:10:22.450
Snow White, if you're not careful,

00:10:22.450 --> 00:10:27.190
a spiteful person will come to kill you with a...

00:10:27.190 --> 00:10:30.910
I turn away all door-to-door salespeople.

00:10:30.910 --> 00:10:33.050
I wouldn't even listen to what they have to say.

00:10:33.050 --> 00:10:35.360
You're surprisingly strong.

00:10:35.690 --> 00:10:36.930
Of course I am.

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:39.780
I'm not a princess for nothing.

00:10:40.040 --> 00:10:44.060
Sit down and I'll bring you 
some fairy forest juice.

00:10:44.060 --> 00:10:45.030
Okay.

00:10:45.030 --> 00:10:45.540
Huh?

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:49.100
So you're here, too.

00:10:50.190 --> 00:10:51.480
What are you reading?

00:10:51.480 --> 00:10:53.210
Why do you care?

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:54.960
She's practicing her lines.

00:10:55.370 --> 00:10:59.060
Masaki's class is performing 
Cinderella this evening.

00:10:59.460 --> 00:11:00.590
Really?

00:11:01.020 --> 00:11:02.590
What part are you playing, Mary?

00:11:02.590 --> 00:11:03.660
A mouse.

00:11:04.740 --> 00:11:06.270
What's so funny?

00:11:06.270 --> 00:11:08.320
You're the perfect size!

00:11:08.320 --> 00:11:09.710
In case you <i>didn't</i> know,

00:11:09.710 --> 00:11:14.400
the mouse has the important 
job of cheering up Cinderella.

00:11:14.750 --> 00:11:16.150
Is that so?

00:11:16.150 --> 00:11:18.480
Have you already memorized your lines?

00:11:18.480 --> 00:11:20.040
Of course I have.

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:22.110
I've got them down to perfection.

00:11:23.890 --> 00:11:25.480
You're bleeding.

00:11:25.480 --> 00:11:28.340
You're so clumsy.

00:11:28.340 --> 00:11:29.790
I'm not clumsy.

00:11:39.110 --> 00:11:41.250
What's wrong, Chizuru-kun?

00:11:41.250 --> 00:11:43.630
I-It's nothing. Nothing at all.

00:11:43.630 --> 00:11:45.300
I didn't do anything clumsy.

00:11:45.300 --> 00:11:45.890
But...

00:11:46.170 --> 00:11:50.670
I need to go get ready for the play.

00:11:50.670 --> 00:11:52.100
Thanks for the food.

00:11:52.100 --> 00:11:53.310
Masaki-chan...

00:11:53.570 --> 00:11:54.360
Huh?

00:11:55.090 --> 00:11:59.030
Break a leg. I'll 
definitely come see your play.

00:11:59.340 --> 00:12:01.220
Really?

00:12:01.220 --> 00:12:02.030
Yes.

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:21.940
No way!

00:12:21.940 --> 00:12:25.460
What's wrong with Mary? She's not cute at all.

00:12:25.460 --> 00:12:28.010
I was only trying to put 
a band-aid on her cut!

00:12:28.310 --> 00:12:30.310
How nostalgic.

00:12:30.720 --> 00:12:34.730
Masaki-chan got mad at me the 
first time I met her, too.

00:12:35.500 --> 00:12:37.310
When I tried to give her a band aid,

00:12:37.310 --> 00:12:40.110
she said she didn't need 
my help and ran away.

00:12:40.420 --> 00:12:43.220
Huh? That happened to you?

00:12:43.730 --> 00:12:47.720
She really doesn't appreciate 
the kindness of others!

00:12:47.720 --> 00:12:51.830
But when I chased her down and tried 
to give it to her again, she took it.

00:12:51.830 --> 00:12:54.180
What? You chased her?

00:12:54.180 --> 00:12:57.140
I was rather persistent.

00:12:57.140 --> 00:12:59.020
What's wrong with that?

00:12:59.020 --> 00:13:00.860
Our shifts should be over soon.

00:13:00.860 --> 00:13:01.590
Okay.

00:13:03.930 --> 00:13:06.150
That's amazing.

00:13:06.150 --> 00:13:09.080
Any normal person wouldn't 
bother chasing her.

00:13:09.850 --> 00:13:10.930
I mean...

00:13:13.540 --> 00:13:15.630
Maybe that's why she likes Shun-chan.

00:13:15.630 --> 00:13:16.580
Chizuru.

00:13:17.180 --> 00:13:17.880
Huh?

00:13:17.880 --> 00:13:21.060
Shouldn't we change before 
we go see the play?

00:13:21.060 --> 00:13:21.940
Yeah, yeah!

00:13:22.410 --> 00:13:24.130
Where's Kaname-kun?

00:13:25.570 --> 00:13:29.040
I'm sure the festival 
committee will understand.

00:13:29.040 --> 00:13:31.230
Okay, thanks.

00:13:32.710 --> 00:13:36.310
He said "they'd understand."

00:13:36.310 --> 00:13:38.300
That's the power of the Student Council.

00:13:38.470 --> 00:13:40.610
Stop saying that.

00:13:40.610 --> 00:13:42.420
I just talked to her normally.

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:44.370
But you're so composed.

00:13:44.370 --> 00:13:48.950
If I were your underclassman, 
I know I'd rely on you.

00:13:48.950 --> 00:13:50.340
Okay, okay.

00:13:50.340 --> 00:13:51.790
There he is!

00:13:51.790 --> 00:13:53.350
Kaname-kun!

00:13:54.600 --> 00:13:56.570
What do you want?

00:13:57.820 --> 00:14:00.140
We've been looking for you.

00:14:00.140 --> 00:14:02.970
You can't ditch the haunted 
house without saying anything.

00:14:02.970 --> 00:14:06.360
Why are you still dressed like that?

00:14:06.750 --> 00:14:07.950
There's no time.

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:10.010
Let's hurry to Masaki-chan's play.

00:14:10.340 --> 00:14:13.500
Huh? Just go if you want to go.

00:14:13.940 --> 00:14:16.230
In fact, you're the only one who...

00:14:16.230 --> 00:14:19.040
No. Masaki-chan worked 
really hard on this.

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:21.810
If we don't all go, I'm sure 
she'll be disappointed!

00:14:21.810 --> 00:14:25.300
I think she'll be disappointed 
by your stupidity.

00:14:26.110 --> 00:14:29.450
Sorry. It looks like you have 
plans with your friends.

00:14:29.450 --> 00:14:30.510
I don't!

00:14:30.510 --> 00:14:32.200
Hello.

00:14:32.200 --> 00:14:33.930
I haven't seen you since the fireworks.

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:35.330
I'm Hanako!

00:14:35.330 --> 00:14:36.930
Don't talk to her!

00:14:37.930 --> 00:14:41.170
Oh, no. We don't have time to change.

00:14:41.170 --> 00:14:43.250
Way to go, Cinderella!

00:14:43.250 --> 00:14:44.800
Always keeping track of time!

00:14:44.800 --> 00:14:46.610
I'm Snow White.

00:14:46.910 --> 00:14:49.570
We don't have time to discuss this.

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:52.160
Oh well! We'll have to go straight there!

00:14:52.160 --> 00:14:53.220
Let's go!

00:14:53.220 --> 00:14:56.580
Hey! Cut it out! I've got plans!

00:14:56.580 --> 00:14:58.960
They're as lively as ever.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:01.440
How nice.

00:15:02.110 --> 00:15:05.700
Bring me a pumpkin, Cinderella.

00:15:05.700 --> 00:15:07.280
A pumpkin?

00:15:07.280 --> 00:15:10.590
That's right. The biggest one you can find.

00:15:10.870 --> 00:15:15.350
I understand. I will bring you 
the biggest pumpkin I can find.

00:15:11.860 --> 00:15:15.350
This brings back memories. It still smells the same.

00:15:15.350 --> 00:15:16.970
There's a good girl.

00:15:16.970 --> 00:15:18.350
Be quiet.

00:15:18.900 --> 00:15:22.190
What were you talking to
 Tachibana-kun and his friends about?

00:15:22.190 --> 00:15:25.050
Tachibana? Oh, that short kid?

00:15:25.050 --> 00:15:27.740
I just told him he's short.

00:15:28.170 --> 00:15:30.790
You're one to talk.

00:15:30.790 --> 00:15:32.970
He probably thought you were his age.

00:15:32.970 --> 00:15:34.950
That's impossible!

00:15:34.950 --> 00:15:37.360
I'll have to talk to him later.

00:15:37.360 --> 00:15:39.750
What are you talking about?

00:15:40.060 --> 00:15:41.980
Wait, Onee-sama. I didn't mean...

00:15:40.610 --> 00:15:43.790
<i>What am I gonna do? I'm so nervous.</i>

00:15:44.430 --> 00:15:46.810
<i>Okay, just... just...</i>

00:15:49.620 --> 00:15:52.410
<i>Shun-chan said he'd come, 
so I have to do a good job.</i>

00:15:53.000 --> 00:15:57.180
<i>B-But having him watch makes 
me even more nervous.</i>

00:15:57.720 --> 00:15:59.560
<i>It's okay.</i>

00:15:59.560 --> 00:16:02.870
<i>With all these people here, I 
won't be able to tell where...</i>

00:16:02.870 --> 00:16:04.690
<i>He's right there!</i>

00:16:04.920 --> 00:16:06.490
Sato-san, we're up!

00:16:06.490 --> 00:16:07.500
Okay!

00:16:15.050 --> 00:16:19.200
<i>Um... I need to say my lines...</i>

00:16:19.560 --> 00:16:24.070
Um... Poor Cinderella!

00:16:24.070 --> 00:16:25.210
Today...

00:16:26.710 --> 00:16:31.390
Her stepmother and sisters must 
have bullied her again...

00:16:37.010 --> 00:16:38.500
<i>I screwed up.</i>

00:16:53.370 --> 00:16:54.320
Masaki-chan!

00:16:55.680 --> 00:16:59.660
Good work. The play was fantastic...

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:01.950
What? Masaki-chan!

00:17:06.120 --> 00:17:09.880
Hey, Mary? Where'd you go?

00:17:10.240 --> 00:17:11.260
Sheesh.

00:17:19.300 --> 00:17:22.060
<b>Girls' Bathroom</b>

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:26.010
I can't believe I screwed 
up such easy lines.

00:17:26.010 --> 00:17:29.820
It was my chance to show off to Shun-chan.

00:17:30.440 --> 00:17:33.940
What am I gonna do? I can't 
see Shun-chan like this.

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:35.960
Mary?

00:17:38.380 --> 00:17:42.400
Wh-What are you doing in the girls' bathroom?

00:17:42.400 --> 00:17:45.800
What's wrong with Bathroom 
Hanako-san going in the girl's bathroom?

00:17:45.800 --> 00:17:47.790
There's something wrong with your head!

00:17:47.790 --> 00:17:50.570
So this is what the girls' bathroom looks like.

00:17:50.570 --> 00:17:51.380
Get out!

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:52.390
Ow!

00:17:52.390 --> 00:17:54.470
You're telling me to get out?

00:17:54.950 --> 00:17:57.750
Then, you should get out of here, too.

00:17:58.300 --> 00:17:59.740
Everyone's looking for you.

00:18:06.380 --> 00:18:09.360
Did you screw up your lines? Huh?

00:18:10.070 --> 00:18:14.280
Ow! Why are you so violent?

00:18:16.880 --> 00:18:20.010
So you messed up one or two lines...

00:18:20.100 --> 00:18:24.580
So what? The girl playing 
Cinderella messed up way more.

00:18:24.970 --> 00:18:27.170
And she wasn't cute at all.

00:18:27.170 --> 00:18:29.990
It was my own fault for expecting more.

00:18:31.740 --> 00:18:34.550
Hey, are you listening?

00:18:34.550 --> 00:18:38.700
Are you listening?

00:18:51.100 --> 00:18:52.770
M-My wig!

00:18:52.770 --> 00:18:54.860
Do you want to try my wig on?

00:18:55.630 --> 00:18:58.200
I guess not. I suppose you wouldn't want to.

00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:05.890
When...

00:19:07.010 --> 00:19:13.230
When I was rehearsing, I could say them.

00:19:14.660 --> 00:19:16.500
I know that.

00:19:17.650 --> 00:19:20.230
Everyone watching the play could tell.

00:19:29.990 --> 00:19:33.610
Shun-chan knows, too.

00:19:36.570 --> 00:19:39.320
Did Shun-chan say that?

00:19:39.320 --> 00:19:40.900
No, but...

00:19:44.000 --> 00:19:47.400
B-But he knows! Honestly!

00:19:47.400 --> 00:19:52.080
But Shun-chan didn't watch me rehearse.

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:53.670
He doesn't have to see you to know!

00:19:53.670 --> 00:19:55.970
Don't underestimate a man's imagination!

00:19:55.970 --> 00:19:57.990
But what if he doesn't know?

00:19:57.990 --> 00:20:01.040
He does know! 100%!

00:20:01.840 --> 00:20:03.020
He knows!

00:20:03.640 --> 00:20:04.740
He really does!

00:20:06.110 --> 00:20:07.010
Definitely!

00:20:16.070 --> 00:20:17.000
Okay!

00:20:17.450 --> 00:20:18.700
Come on, let's go.

00:20:29.100 --> 00:20:30.450
Unbelievable.

00:20:31.170 --> 00:20:36.090
You're the only one who'd 
run to the bathroom.

00:20:36.090 --> 00:20:41.620
These days, kids go to the 
roof or the river, Mary-san.

00:20:41.620 --> 00:20:44.330
Shut up. I don't need that.

00:20:45.070 --> 00:20:50.180
But you're the only one who'd 
chase me into the girls' bathroom.

00:21:05.920 --> 00:21:08.330
I can't go out looking like this!

00:21:12.230 --> 00:21:15.080
You're really not going?

00:21:15.550 --> 00:21:18.460
If I had the energy to go to
 the dance tonight, I'd go home.

00:21:18.720 --> 00:21:20.970
But it'd make a good memory.

00:21:21.720 --> 00:21:25.700
We've already made plenty of good 
memories, haven't we, bathroom Hanako-san?

00:21:25.700 --> 00:21:26.840
Shut up!

00:21:27.170 --> 00:21:30.890
Sensei! There's a boy dressed 
like a girl in the bathroom!

00:21:31.320 --> 00:21:34.360
Shut up, shut up, shut up.

00:21:35.890 --> 00:21:39.640
<i>When I remember you holding my left hand,</i>

00:21:39.640 --> 00:21:41.400
<i>my entire body feels conflicted...</i>

00:21:42.490 --> 00:21:45.420
<i>and my stomach tickles.</i>

00:21:47.340 --> 00:21:51.780
<i>Your red cheeks traced by the light 
pouring through the window...</i>

00:21:52.650 --> 00:21:55.650
<i>and your brightly smiling eyelashes...</i>

00:21:56.530 --> 00:22:01.420
<i>are all beyond that soft, wavy hair.</i>

00:22:03.740 --> 00:22:10.430
<i>But I end up thinking about 
a future with you and...</i>

00:22:11.870 --> 00:22:13.010
<i>Pervert.</i>

00:22:14.210 --> 00:22:15.350
Chizuru-kun?

00:22:25.390 --> 00:22:28.210
Your attention everyone!

00:22:28.210 --> 00:22:31.400
Who wants to know what the 
 girls' bathroom looks like?

00:22:31.400 --> 00:22:33.370
A-Are you stupid?

00:22:33.880 --> 00:22:38.560
Becoming embarrassed 
tickled my stomach again.

00:24:16.260 --> 00:24:19.710
Crescent Moon Silhouette

00:24:16.260 --> 00:24:19.710
Next time: Crescent Moon Silhouette.
